---
import Icon from '../components/ui/Icon.astro';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  showOverlay?: boolean;
}

const { title, showOverlay = true } = Astro.props;
// Mensagem de retorno (PRG) das telas de autenticação
const flash = Astro.locals.flash;
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="auth-layout">
      <div class={`auth-left ${showOverlay ? 'has-overlay' : ''}`}>
        <div class="bg-image"></div>
        {showOverlay && (
          <div class="overlay-content">
            <div class="brand">
              <img src="/logo-light.png" alt="Banket" class="logo" />
            </div>
            
            <h2 class="hero-text">
              Em alguns instantes você irá transformar a sua gestão em um processo padronizado, auditável e seguro
            </h2>
            
            <div class="info-card">
              <div class="card-header">
                <Icon name="task" size={24} />
                <h3>Auditoria Remota</h3>
              </div>
              <p>A Yosp fornece relatórios visuais que atestam a qualidade do patrimônio, conferindo a tranquilidade necessária para o gestor sair da operação presencial e focar na expansão estratégica de seus contratos.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="carousel-dots">
              <span class="dot active"></span>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <span class="dot"></span>
              <span class="dot"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
      <div class="auth-right">
        <div class="form-container">
          {flash && <div class:list={['auth-alert', `auth-alert-${flash.type}`]} role={flash.type === 'error' ? 'alert' : 'status'}>{flash.message}</div>}
          <slot />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .auth-layout {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
  }

  .auth-left {
    flex: 1;
    position: relative;
    display: none;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .bg-image {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background-image: url('/bg-login.png');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }

  .has-overlay .bg-image::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(227, 83, 54, 0.85) 0%, rgba(183, 44, 20, 0.95) 100%);
  }

  .overlay-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 60px;
    color: white;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .brand {
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .logo {
    height: 48px;
  }

  .hero-text {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .info-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .card-header h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .info-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .carousel-dots {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid white;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .dot.active {
    background-color: white;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .auth-right {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px;
    background-color: white;
  }

  .form-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .auth-left {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  /* Globals for auth forms */
  :global(.auth-alert) {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: center;
  }

  :global(.auth-alert-error) {
    background: #fce8e6;
    color: #b3261e;
  }

  :global(.auth-alert-success) {
    background: #e7f3ea;
    color: #2f6b3a;
  }

  :global(.auth-alert-info) {
    background: #f1f3f4;
    color: #333;
  }

  :global(.auth-subtitle) {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #333;
    margin: -24px 0 32px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  :global(.auth-hint) {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #666;
    margin-top: -12px;
  }
  :global(.auth-title) {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  :global(.auth-logo-center) {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 32px auto;
    height: 48px;
  }

  :global(.auth-form) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  :global(.auth-links) {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
  }

  :global(.auth-links a) {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  :global(.auth-links a:hover) {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
